    "sections": {
        "description": "Kamakura is a calm, editorial block theme for restaurants, cafés, bars and boutique hotels: generous white space, a full-width hero photo under a transparent header, half-and-half chapters of text and photo, staggered room cards and a quiet booking band. It comes with a full homepage, a journal with an optional sidebar, a centred header with dropdown menus and an Explore panel, and nine colour styles including Kamakura Night."
